Toolbox: tfbode
Title: Transfer Function Bode Plotter
Summary: Bode magnitude and phase plots with coefficient entry and Hz or rad/s units
Version: 0.3.0
Author: TFBode contributors
Maintainer: simukaimafongoya
Category: Control Systems
Entity: private individual
License: BSD-3-Clause
ScilabVersion: >= 6.1
Depends: 
Date: 2026-11-03
Description: Plot continuous-time transfer functions from descending-power coefficients
 or existing syslin systems. Includes an interactive dialog, frequency bounds,
 and explicit Hz or rad/s input. Includes Xcos Tools menu actions for selected
 blocks and continuous-time diagrams using lincos. Uses native Bode plotting.
